            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The laptop use in the standby/sleep mode includes the share of the laptop computer production, the energy consumption (use-phase) for the laptop (incl. monitor) and the rail and road transport from factory to user. Energy consumption of laptop computers (use-phase) vary a lot depending on the device looked at. Min.-Max. values are listed;
Synonyms: Notebook, Lifebook; 
UUID: cc2e7bee-80b7-35da-a651-9ba551b7248a</common:generalComment>
