        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">No technology involved, except for the production of the laptop computer, which is described in another dataset.\n\n# Included processes\nDescribes the use of a laptop computer in the standby/sleep mode. Calculated per 1 hour of laptop use. Laptop computer life span assumed to be 4 years. Standby/sleep mode 2 hours a day (office use), 240 days a year. Swiss supply mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
